WEBVTT

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:05.871
<v Safi>Teacher, I saw something brown move beside the rock.

00:00:09.171 --> 00:00:14.540
<v Nuri>Watch the burrow opening. What can you see peeking out first?

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:24.581
<v Safi>Round ears! Now I see a furry animal sitting on the rock.

00:00:27.881 --> 00:00:33.970
<v Nuri>It’s a marmot. Here is a real one. Can you point to the fur on its belly?

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:43.267
<v Safi>It’s coming down from the rock. Can you guess which way leads back to its home?

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:51.736
<v Nuri>Through the opening under the rock. We’ll give it plenty of space.

00:00:55.036 --> 00:01:01.357
<v Safi>Now I remember where the marmot lives. Thank Allah for creating this little mountain animal.
